  "summary": "Prime members report delivery times extending to 3-4 days despite proximity to fulfillment centers, undermining the core value proposition [#tk_2868365] [#tk_128843]. Frequent missed delivery windows and cancelled shipments have led to significant frustration and threats of non-renewal [#tk_2693909] [#tk_594545]. Specific incidents include packages stuck in transit for over a week and failed same-day delivery attempts [#tk_2564088] [#tk_2966434]. Additionally, users cite poor customer service responses to lost packages and aggressive Prime sign-up flows that trap unwilling customers [#tk_457683] [#tk_2061568]."
